commit db91635399470d15fbb47507aa0646552a05c281
Author: Sprite <noreply@sprites.dev>
Date:   Fri Jul 10 05:02:19 2026 +0000

    feat(mobile): keyboard-aware capture, scroll-gated swipe + tongue, pull-to-refresh

    - Capture/editor no longer hide text behind the keyboard: an animated
      paddingBottom tracks the keyboard height (useAnimatedKeyboard), shrinking
      the input above it like Apple Notes; the dictation FAB lifts above it too.
    - Rework capture gestures into direction/position-separated pans so they stop
      fighting the input's own scroll: swipe-down dismisses the keyboard only when
      atTop+keyboardVisible; swipe-up files the page only when scrolled to the
      bottom, so scroll vs. next-note are cleanly distinguished.
    - Add a "tongue" arc that stretches from the bottom on swipe-up, arming
      (accent fill, chevron swap, scale pop) past the threshold to signal that
      release will file the page and open a fresh one.
    - Add pull-to-refresh to the home Feed/Folders tabs.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

